---
// About. One long, readable story with subheads, beside a portrait that
// stays in view. Her current About page is a wall of text; the fix is
// shorter paragraphs and subheads, not more sections. The healing results
// line is Stella's own wording (round 2) and always sits with the support line.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Petal from '../components/Petal.astro';
import { FAITH_LINE, SUPPORT_LINE } from '../data/services';
import { SITE } from '../config';
import { rel } from '../lib/url';

const u = Astro.url;
const photo: string | null = null; // real photo only, e.g. 'images/stella-about.jpg'
const schema = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'AboutPage',
    mainEntity: {
      '@type': 'Person',
      name: SITE.owner,
      jobTitle: 'Certified Pranic Healer',
      worksFor: { '@id': `${SITE.url}/#business` },
      address: { '@type': 'PostalAddress', addressLocality: SITE.city, addressRegion: SITE.region },
    },
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="About Stella Crispo: Divine ReConnection"
  description="Certified Pranic Healer and intuitive reader Stella Crispo on her faith, her training and how she works with people."
  schema={schema}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About Stella"
    title="A lifetime of listening."
    intro="Stella Crispo is an intuitive healer and reader who believes we are all connected to the divine. This is how she came to the work."
  >
    <Fragment slot="aside">
      <div class="hero-cred">
        <p class="hc-k">Certified Pranic Healer</p>
        <p class="hc-v">Studying since <strong>2017</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="hp"><Petal tone="lavender" size={60} /></div>
    </Fragment>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section story" data-parallax-scope>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <aside class="side">
        <div class="frame" data-parallax="0.06">
          {
            photo ? (
              <img src={rel(photo, u)} alt="Stella Crispo" width="900" height="1125" loading="lazy" />
            ) : (
              <div class="sig">
                <img src={rel('images/signature-white.svg', u)} alt="" width="473" height="153" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            )
          }
        </div>
        <ul class="creds" aria-label="Training">
          <li>Advanced Pranic Healing</li>
          <li>Pranic Psychotherapy</li>
          <li>Pranic Crystal Healing</li>
          <li>Pranic Psychic Self-Defense</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>

      <article class="prose" data-reveal-group>
        <h2 data-reveal>A psychic family</h2>
        <p class="big" data-reveal>
          Stella comes from a psychic family and has had intuitive “hits” since she was a child. For a long time she simply lived with
          them. Over the years they became something she could not ignore.
        </p>

        <h2 data-reveal>A nudge toward healing</h2>
        <p data-reveal>
          In 2017, after what she describes as a spiritual nudge from her father, who had passed on, Stella began studying Pranic Healing.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Today, Stella is a Certified Pranic Healer humbled by many successful healings for conditions ranging from headaches to diabetes,
          addictions to suicidal tendencies and several “miracle” Covid cases.
        </p>
        <p class="note" data-reveal>{SUPPORT_LINE}</p>

        <h2 data-reveal>From one reading to many</h2>
        <p data-reveal>
          As her sensitivity to energy grew, so did her intuition. A reading she received changed her life, and she began studying the cards
          herself. That study opened into a deeper intuitive practice and, in time, mediumship.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Her readings combine intuition, energy, messages from loved ones living and passed, and plain conversation. People tell her they
          feel at ease, and comforted by how carefully and sincerely she shares what comes through.
        </p>
        <figure class="pull" data-reveal>
          <blockquote><p>“Thank you, Stella, for the guidance. It was bang on. Super grateful, feel much calmer and lighter.”</p></blockquote>
          <figcaption>R., New Jersey</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <h2 data-reveal>Faith at the center</h2>
        <p class="faith" data-reveal>{FAITH_LINE}</p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Stella sees the messages she receives as more than answers. They can be steps toward resolving conflict and finding emotional
          peace. She is grateful to use her gifts and training to help people on their journey, and says that helping others has become
          part of her own.
        </p>

        <div class="next" data-reveal>
          <a class="btn" href={rel('contact/', u)}>Request a session <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={rel('services/', u)}>See all services <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-cred {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
    rotate: -3deg;
  }
  .hc-k {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-purple-deep);
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .hc-v {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
  }
  .hc-v strong {
    color: var(--color-purple-deep);
  }
  .hp {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10%;
    bottom: -30px;
    rotate: 30deg;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.75fr 1.25fr;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 8rem);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .side {
      position: sticky;
      top: calc(var(--header-h) + 2.5rem);
    }
  }
  .side {
    max-width: 420px;
  }
  .frame {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: 200px 200px 28px 28px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
  }
  .frame > img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .sig {
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 18%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #6b4fa0, var(--color-purple-deep) 55%, #2e1a55);
  }
  .creds {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gray-200);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .creds li::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    margin: 0 0.6rem 0.15rem 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-purple);
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  /* Every subhead in the story shares one size (Stella, round 2). */
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 3rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .big {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .prose .note {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    margin-top: -0.25rem;
  }
  .pull {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gray-200);
  }
  .pull blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .pull p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-purple-deep) !important;
  }
  .pull figcaption {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
  }
  .faith {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-purple-deep) !important;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-purple);
  }
  .next {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
</style>
